  "Description": {
    "Cost": 2460000,
    "UIName": "Hauberk",
    "Id": "chassisdef_hauberk_HAU-CMD",
    "Name": "Hauberk",
    "Details": "The Hauberk mounts improved stealth armor to keep from being targeted effectively. The size of the battlesuit precludes its ability to be transported on OmniMechs or perform anti-'Mech operations, though it does mount a battle claw. Its slow speed generally limits its use to defensive operations, though it has been known to travel by armored personnel carrier.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Standard Parts</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.896</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#2aad3b>Can only be transported by internal bays, can not melee, can not swarm.</b></color>",
